       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PARADEMO.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-FIRST-NAME   PIC X(15) VALUE "HCL".
       01  WS-LAST-NAME    PIC X(15) VALUE "MAINFRAME".

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM 100-HEADER
           PERFORM 200-BODY
           PERFORM 300-FOOTER
           STOP RUN.

       100-HEADER.
           DISPLAY "08 - PARAGRAPHS AND PERFORM".

       200-BODY.
           DISPLAY "FULL NAME: " WS-FIRST-NAME " " WS-LAST-NAME.

       300-FOOTER.
           DISPLAY "PROGRAM COMPLETE".